silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_15_witness_traceability_sections_04_negative_witnesses_concrete_anchor_1#gippidy00_r1 silm:hasLongDescription "The gippidy00_R1 is gippidy00_R1 is the negative witness for probe R1 (catus-collision). It is located at rebuttal/round00/gippidy00.md lines 97-105. The verbatim quote at those lines lists the collision candidates (multiple catus rows, each ambiguous) and establishes that no single catus row uniquely identifies Mittens. This negative witness supports the claim Hom_{O_01}(catus, Mittens) = empty." .
